mbers without leveraging the visuals effectively.\n\nOverall, the Candidate Report is far superior in visualization quality, chart appropriateness, and integration of visuals with insights. The Baseline Report's visuals are rudimentary and lack professional polish.\n\nCandidate scores: Visual clarity (4), Chart appropriateness (3), Text-visual synergy (3) = Total 10\nBaseline scores: Visual clarity (-3), Chart appropriateness (-2), Text-visual synergy (-1) = Total -6\nRelative difference: +16 (capped at +10 due to range limit)",
