hout explaining the chart's message or linking it to insights. The candidate's visuals are integral to the argument, not decorative. Score: +3 (candidate achieves strong synergy and uses visuals to deepen insight).\n\nOverall, the candidate report demonstrates superior visualization practice across all three sub-dimensions relative to the baseline, which is more limited in visual variety, integration, and explanatory depth. The candidate's approach is more professional, appropriate, and insightful.",
