cy improvement (to >85%) and forecasts value trends over 3–6 months with a defined rule and distribution results. It also notes limitations (small time-series sample) and suggests monitoring accuracy. Baseline mentions future validation but does not quantify expected impact or provide a clear predictive mechanism. Candidate shows clearer anticipation of impact. **Score: +1**",
