s more generically (e.g., \"The chart below visualizes...\") and has weaker integration between text and visuals; the insights are stated but not as effectively drawn from or highlighted by the charts. The candidate's visuals are integral to the analytical narrative, not decorative. **Score: +3 (Candidate is clearly better at weaving visuals into the insight narrative).**\n\nOverall, the candidate report demonstrates superior visual presentation across all three criteria, with particular strength in professional design and text-visual integration. The baseline report is adequate but less polished and insightful in its visual communication.",
